# Build context for backend/Dockerfile, which builds from the repo root
# because backend/Cargo.toml has a path dependency on ../crates/worker-protocol.
#
# Deny everything, then add back exactly what the Dockerfile copies. The
# desktop app, node_modules, and the Rust target directories are most of this
# tree and none of them build the image, so a deny list would have to grow
# every time the repo does.
*
!backend/Cargo.toml
!backend/Cargo.lock
!backend/build.rs
!backend/migrations
!backend/src
!crates
**/target
